Package: argon-oneup-sensors
Version: 1.3.3
Architecture: all
Maintainer: GamingTux <gamingtux@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Recommends: lm-sensors
Homepage: https://github.com/GamingTux/argon-oneup-suite
Description: Argon ONE UP & Raspberry Pi CM5 Hardware Sensors Mapping
 Routes and aliases physical hardware sensors (CPU thermal, PWM fan RPM,
 NVMe SSD temperature, CW2217 battery telemetry) via standard lm-sensors
 configuration (/etc/sensors.d/argon-oneup.conf).
 Compatible with all desktop environments, window managers, and servers.
